{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17569","headline":"奉陪段相公晚夏登张仪楼 · 姚康","name":"奉陪段相公晚夏登张仪楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登览值晴开，诗从野思来。\n蜀川新草木，秦日旧楼台。\n池景摇中座，山光接上台。\n近秋宜晚景，极目断浮埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚康","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}